q=a8?"Blueprint One es una app de acompanamiento para bienestar y fototerapia. Reune protocolos publicados, ayuda a compararlos, planificarlos y registrar su seguimiento.":"Blueprint One is a wellness and light-therapy companion app. It brings together published protocols, helps you compare them, plan them and track follow-through."
p=a8?u.Z:u.E
o=a8?"No diagnostica, no prescribe y no sustituye la valoracion de un profesional sanitario.":"It does not diagnose, prescribe or replace assessment from a qualified healthcare professional."
